# 仅由宿主网关读取，不复制到 runs、任务包或 transcript。
# 复制为 .env 后 chmod 600 .env；不需要 source，也不支持 shell 展开。
# 只填写你要使用的通道，YAML 决定模型与协议。
CODEX_API_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
CODEX_API_KEY=
# DeepSeek profiles use the Responses protocol; enter the matching service URL.
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# Claude Code 需要 Anthropic Messages 兼容接口；基础地址一般不带 /v1。
CLAUDE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
CLAUDE_API_KEY=
# Host-only Kimi credentials. Choose the URL matching the purchased service.
# Platform API (pay-as-you-go): https://api.moonshot.ai/v1 (international)
# Platform API (mainland): https://api.moonshot.cn/v1
# Code subscription API: https://api.kimi.com/coding/v1
# These services have different keys/model IDs; do not mix them or auto-fallback.
# Models/effort belong in YAML, never inside the credential file.
KIMI_API_BASE_URL=
KIMI_API_KEY=
